<title>JAPAN: Japan August palladium imports fall 16.5 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan August palladium imports fall 16.5 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's palladium imports in August fell 16.5 percent from a year earlier, according to Finance Ministry data released on Monday.</p>
<p>The figures were as follows (in kg):</p>
<p>		     Aug 96     July 96    Aug 95</p>
<p> Total	     6,770	 6,660	8,112</p>
<p>Major suppliers:</p>
<p> Russia	    4,628	 4,521	5,555</p>
<p> South Africa    1,284	   853	1,232</p>
<p>Imports in the first eight months of 1996 were 54.93 tonnes, against 68.01 tonnes in the same period a year earlier.</p>
<p>--Tokyo Commodities Desk (81-3 3432 6179)</p>
</text>
